{"comments":"AVSync — Audio-Visual Synchronization Primitives\n\n## Purpose\n\nProvides types for synchronized audio-visual elements. Critical for:\n- AI avatar lip-sync\n- Medical device audio-visual alerts\n- Video editing / motion graphics\n- Accessibility (audio descriptions synced to visual state)\n\n## Architecture\n\n```\nAVElement\n  ├── visual :: Element        -- What to render\n  ├── audio :: AudioCue        -- What to play\n  └── sync :: SyncMode         -- How they relate\n\nVoiceElement\n  ├── text :: String           -- What to say\n  ├── voice :: VoiceProfile    -- How to say it\n  └── emotion :: EmotionTag    -- Emotional coloring\n```\n\n## Sync Modes\n\n- `SyncImmediate` — Play audio when visual appears\n- `SyncOnVisible` — Play when element enters viewport\n- `SyncOnProgress` — Scrub audio with animation progress\n- `SyncOnMarker` — Play at specific timeline markers\n\n## Reference\nCouncil gap: COUNCIL_REVIEW.md §3.6 \"MISSING: Audio-visual sync\"\n","declarations":[{"children":[{"comments":null,"info":{"arguments":[],"declType":"dataConstructor"},"sourceSpan":{"end":[87,18],"name":"src/Hydrogen/Audio/AVSync.purs","start":[87,3]},"title":"SyncImmediate"},{"comments":null,"info":{"arguments":[],"declType":"dataConstructor"},"sourceSpan":{"end":[88,18],"name":"src/Hydrogen/Audio/AVSync.purs","start":[88,3]},"title":"SyncOnVisible"},{"comments":null,"info":{"arguments":[{"annotation":[],"contents":[["Prim"],"Number"],"tag":"TypeConstructor"}],"declType":"dataConstructor"},"sourceSpan":{"end":[89,19],"name":"src/Hydrogen/Audio/AVSync.purs","start":[89,3]},"title":"SyncOnProgress"},{"comments":null,"info":{"arguments":[{"annotation":[],"contents":[["Hydrogen","Audio","AVSync"],"TimelineMarker"],"tag":"TypeConstructor"}],"declType":"dataConstructor"},"sourceSpan":{"end":[90,17],"name":"src/Hydrogen/Audio/AVSync.purs","start":[90,3]},"title":"SyncOnMarker"},{"comments":null,"info":{"arguments":[],"declType":"dataConstructor"},"sourceSpan":{"end":[91,15